1
00:00:00,085 --> 00:00:03,070
A day now lasts
about an hour and a half.

2
00:00:03,793 --> 00:00:06,648
At an hour and a half,
you are almost weightless.

3
00:00:07,787 --> 00:00:10,637
You weigh about one eighth
of what you did.

4
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:15,677
A 70 kg person would
weigh about 8 kg.

5
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,970
The same jump that lifts
you half a meter

6
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:23,075
today would carry
you about 4 m,

7
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:26,045
higher
than a basketball hoop.

8
00:00:26,653 --> 00:00:29,418
A cup falling off
a table would take

9
00:00:29,418 --> 00:00:32,173
about 3 times
as long to land.

10
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:38,035
The equator moves at
27,000 km/h.

11
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:43,210
The Sun now crosses the
whole sky in 45 minutes.

12
00:00:44,048 --> 00:00:45,273
One more nudge,

13
00:00:45,273 --> 00:00:47,433
and something
changes completely.

14
00:00:48,858 --> 00:00:50,623
Quick break:
like and follow.

15
00:00:50,863 --> 00:00:53,178
Then let's see
how bad this gets.

16
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,350
One more nudge,

17
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,460
and something
changes completely.

18
00:00:58,552 --> 00:01:00,177
Part 8 of 8.
